  "uuid": "b1223605-7a3e-4974-b995-a180ca26fbb1",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "14c0c9ac-c91e-7878-4d4f-f135ef711cb1",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "9ad9bae0-c2e9-a709-bf86-1d12033726e6",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The focus was on teamwork, rapid thinking and decision-making. Teams were challenged to better each other in timed trials and innovative games developed to test their skills and knowledge.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Teams of residents from across Karachi attended three interactive tutorial sessions following which they had to compete against each other in a quiz. To increase difficulty, participants undertook a rapid fire round testing their decision making, culminating in a hands-on simulation session to complete their understanding of strengths and weaknesses in their performance.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A team of five Radiologists from the department of radiology at AKUH were selected to act the judging, jury and executioner!",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Cool Cats\" turned out to be the eventual winning team, having performed excellently throughout the whole event. If you think you have the courage to handle this uniqueblend of fun and skills, do join us for our next SONOGAMES. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
